1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,541
Cool a normal metal, and its resistance falls, because the lattice ions vibrate less and scatter the electrons less.

2
00:00:08,541 --> 00:00:10,481
But it never reaches zero.

3
00:00:10,481 --> 00:00:16,888
Impurities and defects leave a residual resistivity, even at absolute zero.

